			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"馬扎里"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751310101,
					"content": "生物火雨…難道，真如傳說中那樣，火山噴發會像活物一樣肆意地進化和繁衍，把周邊都同化成火山？完了完了，那可就危險了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310102,
						751310103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				},
				{
					"id": 751310102,
					"content": "火山可不是那樣形成的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751310104,
					"content": "是了是了，沒有熔岩哪裡來的火山。火山是不可能隨便出現的，要不然這裡早就成了危險區域了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				},
				{
					"id": 751310105,
					"content": "但、但要是萬一傳說是真的呢？嗯，要是那個能自動留影的留影機管用就好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				},
				{
					"id": 751310106,
					"content": "等等，萬一留影機出了什麼問題沒拍到畫片，豈不是糟糕了？不行不行，我得找個時間去看一眼才行…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				},
				{
					"id": 751310103,
					"content": "不好意思，打擾了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751310107,
					"content": "再見…還是說，這其中另有隱情？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7513102,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7513105",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7513105,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"馬扎里"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751310201,
					"content": "原來生物火雨就是從天而降的浮燃鳥啊，怪不得範圍比常見的噴發還要大…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				},
				{
					"id": 751310202,
					"content": "糟了，假如牠們哪天砸到了我家裡怎麼辦？不行，必須得要想個辦法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310203,
						751310206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				},
				{
					"id": 751310203,
					"content": "只是特殊情況。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751310204,
					"content": "對啊，浮燃鳥只有靠著火山噴發才有可能飛到天上去，我家又不在火山噴發的範圍裡，應該不需要擔心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				},
				{
					"id": 751310205,
					"content": "但、但要是有一天，來一場史無前例的大噴發呢？那是不是就沒有地方是安全的了？不行不行，還是要想個辦法才是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				},
				{
					"id": 751310206,
					"content": "不好意思，打擾了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751310207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751310207,
					"content": "沒事，不打擾…總而言之，先加固一下房頂吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "馬扎里"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7513103,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7513106
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
